# Check out text files with LF on every OS. EAS fingerprints hash some
# files (.gitignore, eas.json) byte for byte, so CRLF copies on Windows
# gave builds made from a laptop a different fingerprint from the updates
# EAS publishes from GitHub, and those updates never reached the phone.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
